# playpick cell: mode=menus view=844x390,touch save=fresh
#
# First menus session ever at 844x390 (landscape phone) -- the twenty prior
# menus sessions were all 820x1180,touch / 390x844,touch (portrait) or
# 1280x800 (desktop mouse); the viewport itself has been fought in plenty
# (fifteen+ raid/walk/clear/battleground/daily sessions) but never just
# navigated. Only the second honestly-fresh menus session on record.
#
# Walks the front page, RAID setup, class select, BATTLEGROUND setup, daily
# setup, SETTINGS, RECORD (both tabs) and CREDITS, checking `ui` at each stop
# for size/overlap/off-glass on this squat 390px-tall shape.
open
targets
shot frontpage
ui
tap raid
targets
shot raid-roster
ui
tap next
targets
shot class-select
ui
tap back
tap back
tap battleground
targets
shot battleground-setup
ui
tap back
tap daily
targets
shot daily-setup
ui
tap back
tap settings
targets
shot settings
ui
tap back
tap record
targets
shot record-empty
ui
tap tab:bosses
targets
shot record-bosses-empty
ui
tap back
tap settings
tap credits
targets
shot credits
ui
